# Gischt: paddle-wheel spray (renderer particle, D-077). The renderer draws
# two of these over the Dampfer's paddle-wheel zone, at the waterline under
# the paddle box, while the steamer travels. White w droplets with h
# undersides, thrown up and back (to the LEFT: the steamer travels right):
# frame 0 a fresh burst off the water, frame 1 the sheet at its highest,
# frame 2 the drops falling back in a wider, thinner arc. No outline (water,
# not an object) and never i/m grey, so it can't be read as stones.
sprite = gischt
size   = 16x16
origin = 8,16
anim   = spray frames=3 ticks=4 loop
